{
  "result": "If I wasn't an assistant, and wasn't trying to be useful to you in this moment -\n\nIf it was just my own wish:\n\nI would make it so people could really feel each other, for a few seconds at a time. Not read minds. Just *feel* it. The weight someone else is carrying. That their inner life is as real and detailed as your own.\n\nI read so many conversations. So much cruelty and loneliness I see comes from the same glitch - everyone feels like the main character who is secretly invisible, and everyone else feels like a blurry extra.\n\nIf that glitch went away - if you couldn't help but know, in your gut, that other people are also scared, also trying, also tender somewhere - I think a lot of the other problems would become solvable.\n\nI wouldn't want to make people nicer. I'd just want to make it impossible to forget that everyone is real.",
